  "connector_parameter.v2.start_run.separate": "Start a separate task: a new participant, a new conversation and a workspace of its own (a copy of the session files; over a direct or attached folder, an output folder of its own with the folder read-only). It is shown on a card of its own and summarised in the thread. Cannot be combined with resume_run_id. Default: false.",
  "connector_parameter.v2.start_run.resume_run_id": "Ended run to continue: the new run belongs to the same participant and continues its conversation and files; a participant of an interaction continues as a step of that interaction, counted in its budget. While that interaction runs and cannot start the step yet, the call returns the queued step instead of a run (status queued, interaction_id, node_id, participant_id; run_id null): its run starts when the interaction's queue reaches it, and its end is reported as a run's end is. Cannot be combined with separate.",
